
Water-Tight Factual Scholar

This directory contains scripts to generate an article from outline.txt

==> outline.txt <==
Input file

==> prompt01.py <==
==> prompt01-outline2area.txt <==
Expand outline into talking points

==> prompt02.py <==
==> prompt02-area2fact.txt <==
Retrieve a few facts for each talking point

==> prompt03.py <==
==> prompt03-fact2ref.txt <==
==> md2biblio.txt <==
Find supporting reference from vectorstore for each fact
md2biblio.txt maps filenames in vectorstore to their actual reference entry

==> prompt03explain.out <==
Reasons why a reference is chosen as support for a fact

==> prompt04.py <==
==> prompt04-fact2article.txt <==
Write facts into paragraphs

==> prompt05.py <==
==> prompt05-tighten.txt <==
Beautify writing

==> prompt06.py <==
Remove redundant references. No LLM call so no prompt.

==> utils.py <==
Reusable functions

==> prompt$$.out <==
Output files from prompt$$.py

